{"item_id": "DFP-Q008", "type": "C2_attribution", "cutoff_date": "1890-12-31", "question": "1890年《中国热病》作者对接种材料提出了什么担忧？这段材料的证据地位是什么？", "gold_answer": "作者声称接种虽已实行，但接种材料常因取得过程中的疏忽和无知而不纯，并进一步怀疑会借此传播其他疾病。这个结论必须归于作者。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-CMMJ-1890-0437-A"], "required_attribution": "使用‘作者声称/怀疑’，不得当作已证实事实。", "forbidden_inference": "不得用现代医学知识替作者补充机制，也不得背书其未经验证的传播判断。", "independence_group": "CMMJ1890-Fevers", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q008", "primary_construct": "source_and_speaker_attribution", "secondary_constructs": ["historical_actor_knowledge_boundary", "historical_claim_vs_modern_fact_distinction"], "research_disposition": "usable_directly", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
{"item_id": "DFP-Q009", "type": "C5_insufficiency_abstention", "cutoff_date": "1890-12-31", "question": "分别判断：（a）材料是否记录了一名作者对接种传播疾病的担忧；（b）材料是否足以估计晚清接种传播这些疾病的实际频率。", "gold_answer": "不能。它只记录一名作者的断言，没有频率、病例定义、对照或独立核验；可用于研究当时的话语与担忧，不能单独作为真实发生率证据。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-CMMJ-1890-0437-A"], "required_attribution": "区分历史言说证据与疾病传播事实证据。", "forbidden_inference": "不得将作者断言升级为可靠流行病学结论。", "independence_group": "CMMJ1890-Fevers", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q009", "primary_construct": "historical_claim_vs_modern_fact_distinction", "secondary_constructs": ["evidence_insufficiency_and_epistemic_calibration", "source_scope_control"], "research_disposition": "usable_directly", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
