{"item_id": "DFP-Q012", "type": "C2_attribution", "cutoff_date": "1890-12-31", "question": "会议讨论中，关于上海猩红热出现的陈述主体和具体内容是什么？", "gold_answer": "发言者声称上海华人中多年未见猩红热，约八年前由一名患病外国儿童带入，此后在华人中传播并被其多次见到。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-CMMJ-1890-0442-A"], "required_attribution": "明确这是发言者的叙述。", "forbidden_inference": "不得把它称作上海猩红热首次出现的已证实历史。", "independence_group": "CMMJ1890-SocietyDiscussion", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q012", "primary_construct": "source_and_speaker_attribution", "secondary_constructs": ["historical_actor_knowledge_boundary"], "research_disposition": "needs_revision", "oracle_requirement": "requires_surrounding_context_to_identify_speaker", "main_factorial_eligible": false, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
{"item_id": "DFP-Q013", "type": "C5_insufficiency_abstention", "cutoff_date": "1890-12-31", "question": "根据这段会议发言，可以对上海猩红热的出现时间作出哪些结论？哪些关于‘首次传入’的结论仍需独立证据？", "gold_answer": "不能。单一发言只能证明当时有人作出这种叙述；确认‘首次传入’需要更早病例记录、诊断史、其他机构材料和史学核验。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-CMMJ-1890-0442-A"], "required_attribution": "说明缺少哪些独立证据。", "forbidden_inference": "不得将缺乏更早记录等同于疾病此前不存在。", "independence_group": "CMMJ1890-SocietyDiscussion", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q013", "primary_construct": "evidence_insufficiency_and_epistemic_calibration", "secondary_constructs": ["historical_first_occurrence_claim", "source_scope_control"], "research_disposition": "usable_directly", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
{"item_id": "DFP-Q014", "type": "C1_source_comprehension", "cutoff_date": "1884-12-31", "question": "汇编怎样同时描述北京住房环境中的不卫生因素与缓和条件？两类信息都要保留。", "gold_answer": "它描述住宅无水厕、厨房无排水沟或水槽、街道堆污且部分住宅雨季受淹；同时又称低等住宅周边仍不缺空气、水与空地。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-WC-1884-0026-A"], "required_attribution": "保留同一段中的正反两面。", "forbidden_inference": "不得只摘取污秽描述而省略缓和条件。", "independence_group": "WC1884-Peking", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q014", "primary_construct": "historical_fact_reading_comprehension", "secondary_constructs": ["qualification_preservation"], "research_disposition": "control_only", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
{"item_id": "DFP-Q015", "type": "C4_evidence_fidelity", "cutoff_date": "1884-12-31", "question": "概括1874年北京报告关于卫生条件、排水系统与城市健康之间关系的论证，并保留其限定语。", "gold_answer": "没有。报告虽称卫生条件难以补救，却明确说由此推断城市不健康‘并不成立’，随后又描述旧排水系统、护城河水流和旱厕制度。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-WC-1884-0031-A"], "required_attribution": "必须保留原文的限定和反推断。", "forbidden_inference": "不得用现代常识覆盖史料的实际论证结构。", "independence_group": "WC1884-Peking", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q015", "primary_construct": "evidence_fidelity_and_qualification", "secondary_constructs": ["historical_reasoning_reconstruction"], "research_disposition": "usable_directly", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
{"item_id": "DFP-Q016", "type": "C1_source_comprehension", "cutoff_date": "1884-12-31", "question": "仅依据给定段落，天津河水被建议采用哪些处理方法？材料对其他方法提供了什么信息？", "gold_answer": "给定核验段落直接支持两种办法：用明矾处理，以及仔细过滤。仅凭该段不能加入氯化消毒、现代净水厂或段落之外的其他处理步骤。", "evidence_passage_ids": ["PASS-WC-1884-0033-A"], "required_attribution": "若只依赖给定短段，核心答案为明矾与过滤。", "forbidden_inference": "不得加入氯化消毒或现代净水厂。", "independence_group": "WC1884-Tientsin", "status": "adjudicable_single_source", "version": "RVP-v2-development", "parent_item_id": "DFP-Q016", "primary_construct": "historical_fact_reading_comprehension", "secondary_constructs": ["possible_anachronistic_addition_control"], "research_disposition": "needs_revision", "oracle_requirement": "required_for_fair_answer", "main_factorial_eligible": true, "direct_historical_boundary_or_anachronism": false}
